{"id": "90010009", "name": "קבועים שעבורם u+iv אנליטית – משוואות קושי–רימן והשוואת מקדמים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונות הפונקציות</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u(x,y)=ay^2+{{CT:0}},\\qquad v(x,y)=bxy+cx+dy, \\]</p><p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b,c,d\\)</span> קבועים ממשיים.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b,c,d\\)</span> כך שהפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x+iy)=u(x,y)+i\\,v(x,y)\\)</span> תהיה אנליטית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a=\\) [[input:ans1]]&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(b=\\) [[input:ans2]]&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(c=\\) [[input:ans3]]&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(d=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לפונקציות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v\\)</span> יש נגזרות חלקיות רציפות, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> גזירה בנקודה בדיוק כאשר מתקיימות בה משוואות קושי–רימן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_x=v_y,\\ u_y=-v_x\\)</span>. כדי ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> תהיה אנליטית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> המשוואות צריכות להתקיים לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y\\)</span>, ומשווים מקדמים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרות החלקיות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u_x={{CT:1}},\\quad u_y=2ay+{{CT:2}},\\qquad v_x=by+c,\\quad v_y=bx+d. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_x=v_y\\)</span></b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}}=bx+d\\ \\text{ לכל } x\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad b={{CT:3}},\\quad d={{CT:4}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_y=-v_x\\)</span></b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 2ay+({{CT:2}})=-by-c\\ \\text{ לכל } y\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad a=-\\frac{b}{2}={{CT:5}},\\quad c={{CT:6}}. \\]</p>ואז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(z)={{CT:7}}\\)</span> (בדיקה: בהצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=x+iy\\)</span> מקבלים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>).<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:5}},\\quad b={{CT:3}},\\quad c={{CT:6}},\\quad d={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,ans2,ans3,ans4]", "tans": "[a,b,c,d]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans2,ans4]", "tans": "[b,d]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הערכים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b,d\\)</span> (מהמשוואה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_x=v_y\\)</span>) נכונים. בדקו את המשוואה השנייה, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u_y=-v_x\\)</span>, עם המינוס.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,a